      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "Awesome! Glad we could find a solution.\n\nAvatars will only get occluded if occlusion culling is properly configured in your world - make sure that your geometry is marked as \"static\", and consider designing your world in a way that reduces the amount of visible players.\n\nPlease keep in mind that renderers are occluded, but some components will continue running.",
