  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-05-04T17:34:14.606Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I would like a setting for occlusion culling avatars in world settings.\n\nIt will have a very large effect on large worlds.\n\nVRChat already has avatar culling which is the equivalent of LOD, but it requires user interaction.\n\nAlso, avatars in the same room will not be drawn, but avatars on the other side of a wall will be drawn.",
